# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg

# Test results and coverage
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/coverage/
**/coverage.*
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml

# IDE and local tooling
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.claude/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Environment files (allow credential-free templates)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Certificates and private keys
**/*.cer
**/*.crt
**/*.csr
**/*.der
**/*.jks
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.ppk
